        "id": "major-question-01",
        "label": "大問1",
        "order": 1,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><h2>大問1 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>(1)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{m}{M+m}v\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(2)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{mv}{M+m}\\right)^{2}-\\frac{kx^{2}}{M+m}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(3)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{mv}{\\sqrt{k(M+m)}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(4)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{M+m}{k}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(5)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2\\sqrt{\\frac{M+m}{k}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div></dl></section><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>学習の入口</strong><p>まず衝突直後だけ運動量保存で切り出します。その後は、ばね区間ならエネルギー保存と周期、粗い面なら等加速度運動へ法則を切り替えます。</p></aside><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(1)</h3><p class=\"prose\">衝突直後の速さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおいて，運動量保存則を用いると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"mv=(M+m)V_1\\qquad\\therefore\\quad V_1=\\frac{m}{M+m}v\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(2)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める速さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおいて，力学的エネルギー保存則を用いると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{1}{2}(M+m)V_1^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}(M+m)V_2^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}kx^{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\quad V_2=\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{mv}{M+m}\\right)^{2}-\\frac{kx^{2}}{M+m}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(3)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める距離を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおいて，力学的エネルギー保存則を用いると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{1}{2}(M+m)V_1^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}kx_0^{2}\\qquad\\therefore\\quad x_0=\\frac{mv}{\\sqrt{k(M+m)}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(4)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める時間 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は単振動の周期の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{1}{4}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となるので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"t_0=\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{M+m}{k}}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{M+m}{k}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(5)</h3><p class=\"prose\">静止するまでに要した時間を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>，加速度を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと，等加速度直線運動の速度の公式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"0=V_1+at\\qquad\\therefore\\quad a=-\\frac{V_1}{t}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">静止するまでに移動した距離を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと，等加速度直線運動の変位の公式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x=V_1t+\\frac{1}{2}\\left(-\\frac{V_1}{t}\\right)t^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}V_1t\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">これが(3)と同じ距離となるので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{1}{2}V_1t=\\frac{mv}{\\sqrt{k(M+m)}}\\qquad\\therefore\\quad t=2\\sqrt{\\frac{M+m}{k}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "大問2",
        "order": 2,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><h2>大問2 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>(1)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2qV}{m}}\\,[\\mathrm{m/s}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(2)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{2}{d}\\sqrt{\\frac{2mV}{q}}\\,[\\mathrm{T}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(3)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{B^{2}L^{2}}{2V}\\,[\\mathrm{kg/C}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(4)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"d\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{m&#39;}{m}}-1\\right)[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(5)</dt><dd>24.3</dd></div></dl></section><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>学習の入口</strong><p>最初に電位差で得た速さを確定し、磁界中ではローレンツ力を向心力に置きます。検出距離が質量の平方根に比例する形を残すと後半が短くなります。</p></aside><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(1)</h3><p class=\"prose\">スリットSに入射するときの速さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_0\\,[\\mathrm{m/s}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおいて，エネルギーの関係を用いると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{1}{2}mv_0^{2}=qV\\qquad\\therefore\\quad v_0=\\sqrt{\\frac{2qV}{m}}\\,[\\mathrm{m/s}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(2)</h3><p class=\"prose\">回転半径が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{1}{2}d\\,[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となるので，磁束密度の大きさ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"B\\,[\\mathrm{T}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は，円運動の運動方程式をたてると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"m\\frac{v_0^{2}}{\\frac{1}{2}d}=qv_0B\\qquad\\therefore\\quad B=\\frac{2}{d}\\sqrt{\\frac{2mV}{q}}\\,[\\mathrm{T}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(3)</h3><p class=\"prose\">回転半径が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"L\\,[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となるときを考える。円運動の運動方程式をたてると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"m\\frac{v_0^{2}}{L}=qv_0B\\qquad\\therefore\\quad v_0=\\frac{qBL}{m}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(1)より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2qV}{m}}=\\frac{qBL}{m}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">両辺を2乗して</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{2qV}{m}=\\frac{q^{2}B^{2}L^{2}}{m^{2}}\\qquad\\therefore\\quad\\frac{m}{q}=\\frac{B^{2}L^{2}}{2V}\\,[\\mathrm{kg/C}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(4)</h3><p class=\"prose\">(2)より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"d=\\frac{2}{B}\\sqrt{\\frac{2mV}{q}}\\,[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">同様にして，質量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m&#39;\\,[\\mathrm{kg}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> での距離 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"d&#39;\\,[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"d&#39;=\\frac{2}{B}\\sqrt{\\frac{2m&#39;V}{q}}\\,[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">よって</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"d&#39;=\\sqrt{\\frac{m&#39;}{m}}\\,d\\quad\\cdots\\cdots\\text{①}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">求める距離 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\\,[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m&#39;&gt;m\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x=d&#39;-d=d\\left(\\sqrt{\\frac{m&#39;}{m}}-1\\right)[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>注</strong><p>解答に <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"B\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を用いてよいと考えれば，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"d\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を代入して <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=\\frac{2}{B}\\sqrt{\\frac{2V}{q}}\\left(\\sqrt{m&#39;}-\\sqrt{m}\\right)[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> も正解である。</p></aside></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(5)</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\mathrm{P_1}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\mathrm{P_3}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の位置で検出された同位体の質量をそれぞれ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m_1\\,[\\mathrm{u}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m_3\\,[\\mathrm{u}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおき，①を用いると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"58.8=60.0\\sqrt{\\frac{m_1}{25}}\\qquad\\therefore\\quad m_1=24.01\\fallingdotseq24\\,[\\mathrm{u}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"61.2=60.0\\sqrt{\\frac{m_3}{25}}\\qquad\\therefore\\quad m_3=26.01\\fallingdotseq26\\,[\\mathrm{u}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">元素の原子量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x=\\frac{24\\times1975+25\\times248+26\\times277}{1975+248+277}=\\frac{60802}{2500}=24.32\\fallingdotseq24.3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-03",
        "label": "大問3",
        "order": 3,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-03\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-03\"><h2>大問3 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>(1)</dt><dd>ア</dd></div><div><dt>(2)</dt><dd>オ</dd></div><div><dt>(3)</dt><dd>ウ</dd></div><div><dt>(4)</dt><dd>エ</dd></div><div><dt>(5)</dt><dd>ウ</dd></div></dl></section><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>学習の入口</strong><p>反射回数による位相差を最初に確認し、次に2本の波の幾何から経路差を作ります。膜の問題では光路長差と縞の移動を同じ式にそろえます。</p></aside><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(1)</h3><p class=\"prose\">2つの平面波はともに2回ずつ固定端反射をするから，反射による位相のずれはないので，強め合う条件は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"l_3+l_4-l_1-l_2=m\\lambda\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(2)</h3><p class=\"prose\">(1)と同様に考えて，弱め合う条件は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"l_3+l_4-l_1-l_2=\\frac{\\lambda}{2}(2m+1)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(3)</h3><p class=\"prose\">次図のようにスクリーンでの経路差0の点をO，隣り合う明部の位置をO′，求める間隔を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"d\\,[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおくと，経路差は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2d\\sin\\theta\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となるので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"2d\\sin\\theta=\\lambda\\qquad\\therefore\\quad d=\\frac{\\lambda}{2\\sin\\theta}\\,[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><figure class=\"batch-figure-pending\" data-figure-placeholder=\"true\" data-figure-id=\"a3-path-difference\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"スクリーン上の点OとO′における二つの波面の経路差2d sinθを示す解説の作図（2枚組）（図版準備中）\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.788\"><strong>図版準備中</strong><p>スクリーン上の点OとO′における二つの波面の経路差2d sinθを示す解説の作図（2枚組）</p></div><figcaption>図の位置・大きさを確保しています。図を使う説明は確認完了までレビュー中です。</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(4)</h3><p class=\"prose\">隣り合う明部の間隔と暗部の間隔は等しいので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"l=md=\\frac{m\\lambda}{2\\sin\\theta}\\,[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(5)</h3><p class=\"prose\">透明な膜による光路長の変化は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"nt-t=(n-1)t\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">位置が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\delta\\,[\\mathrm{m}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> ずれたときの経路差は(3)と同様にして，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2\\delta\\sin\\theta\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> となる。この2つが一致するので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"(n-1)t=2\\delta\\sin\\theta\\qquad\\therefore\\quad n=1+\\frac{2\\delta\\sin\\theta}{t}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">(3)より <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sin\\theta\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を消去すると</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"n=1+\\frac{\\delta\\lambda}{dt}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-04",
        "label": "大問4",
        "order": 4,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-04\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-04\"><h2>大問4 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>(1)</dt><dd>カ</dd></div><div><dt>(2)</dt><dd>オ</dd></div><div><dt>(3)</dt><dd>ウ</dd></div><div><dt>(4)</dt><dd>エ</dd></div><div><dt>(5)</dt><dd>ア</dd></div></dl></section><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>学習の入口</strong><p>各過程で、状態方程式・内部エネルギー・P–Vグラフの面積のどれを使うかを分けます。問5は途中状態を1変数で表して吸収熱の極大を探します。</p></aside><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(1)</h3><p class=\"prose\">気体の物質量を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"n\\,[\\mathrm{mol}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>，状態A，B，Cの絶対温度をそれぞれ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"T_\\mathrm{A}\\,[\\mathrm{K}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"T_\\mathrm{B}\\,[\\mathrm{K}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"T_\\mathrm{C}\\,[\\mathrm{K}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。過程A→Bにおいて放出した熱量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"Q_\\mathrm{AB}\\,[\\mathrm{J}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は，気体定数を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"R\\,[\\mathrm{J/mol\\cdot K}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とし</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"Q_\\mathrm{AB}=\\frac{5}{2}nR(T_\\mathrm{A}-T_\\mathrm{B})=\\frac{5}{2}(P_0\\cdot4V_0-P_0V_0)=\\frac{15}{2}P_0V_0\\,[\\mathrm{J}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(2)</h3><p class=\"prose\">ボイル・シャルルの法則より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{P_0V_0}{T_\\mathrm{B}}=\\frac{5P_0V_0}{T_\\mathrm{C}}\\qquad\\therefore\\quad\\frac{T_\\mathrm{C}}{T_\\mathrm{B}}=5\\ \\text{倍}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(3)</h3><p class=\"prose\">状態Dでの圧力を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P_\\mathrm{D}\\,[\\mathrm{Pa}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>，体積を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V_\\mathrm{D}\\,[\\mathrm{m^3}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。問題文の式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"P_\\mathrm{D}=-\\frac{3P_0}{V_0}V_\\mathrm{D}+8P_0\\qquad\\therefore\\quad P_\\mathrm{D}V_\\mathrm{D}=-\\frac{3P_0}{V_0}V_\\mathrm{D}^{2}+8P_0V_\\mathrm{D}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">ボイル・シャルルの法則より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{P_\\mathrm{D}V_\\mathrm{D}}{T_\\mathrm{A}}=\\frac{P_0\\cdot4V_0}{T_\\mathrm{A}}\\qquad\\therefore\\quad P_\\mathrm{D}V_\\mathrm{D}=4P_0V_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">よって</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"4P_0V_0=-\\frac{3P_0}{V_0}V_\\mathrm{D}^{2}+8P_0V_\\mathrm{D}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{3P_0}{V_0}V_\\mathrm{D}^{2}-8P_0V_\\mathrm{D}+4P_0V_0=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"3V_\\mathrm{D}^{2}-8V_0V_\\mathrm{D}+4V_0^{2}=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"(3V_\\mathrm{D}-2V_0)(V_\\mathrm{D}-2V_0)=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\quad V_\\mathrm{D}=\\frac{2}{3}V_0,\\ 2V_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V_\\mathrm{D}&gt;V_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> より <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V_\\mathrm{D}=2V_0\\,[\\mathrm{m^3}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(4)</h3><p class=\"prose\">問題文の式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"P_\\mathrm{D}=-\\frac{3P_0}{V_0}2V_0+8P_0=2P_0\\,[\\mathrm{Pa}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> グラフの台形の面積より，気体が外部にする仕事 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"W\\,[\\mathrm{J}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"W=\\frac{1}{2}(5P_0+2P_0)\\cdot(2V_0-V_0)=\\frac{7}{2}P_0V_0\\,[\\mathrm{J}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(5)</h3><p class=\"prose\">過程C→Dの途中の任意の状態を状態 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とし，そのときの圧力を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P_x\\,[\\mathrm{Pa}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>，体積を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V_x=(1+x)V_0\\,[\\mathrm{m^3}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"0&lt;x&lt;1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>）。</p><p class=\"prose\">問題文の式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"P_x=-\\frac{3P_0}{V_0}(1+x)V_0+8P_0=5P_0-3P_0x\\,[\\mathrm{Pa}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">過程C→<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> での仕事 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"W_x\\,[\\mathrm{J}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> グラフの面積より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"W_x=\\frac{1}{2}(5P_0+5P_0-3P_0x)\\{(1+x)V_0-V_0\\}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"=\\frac{1}{2}(10P_0-3P_0x)xV_0=\\frac{1}{2}(10-3x)xP_0V_0\\,[\\mathrm{J}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">過程C→<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> での内部エネルギーの変化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\Delta U_x\\,[\\mathrm{J}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\Delta U_x=\\frac{3}{2}\\{(5P_0-3P_0x)(1+x)V_0-5P_0V_0\\}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"=\\frac{3}{2}(-3x^{2}+2x)P_0V_0\\,[\\mathrm{J}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">過程C→<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> において吸収した熱量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"Q_x\\,[\\mathrm{J}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は，熱力学第一法則より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"Q_x=\\Delta U_x+W_x\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"=\\frac{3}{2}(-3x^{2}+2x)P_0V_0+\\frac{1}{2}(10-3x)xP_0V_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"=P_0V_0\\left\\{-6\\left(x-\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{2}+\\frac{8}{3}\\right\\}[\\mathrm{J}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">状態Xのとき，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"Q_x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は極大となるので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x=\\frac{2}{3}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">状態Xでの圧力 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"P_{\\frac{2}{3}}\\,[\\mathrm{Pa}]\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は，問題文の式より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"P_{\\frac{2}{3}}=-\\frac{3P_0}{V_0}\\left(1+\\frac{2}{3}\\right)V_0+8P_0=3P_0\\,[\\mathrm{Pa}]\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      }
    ]
  },
